<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_901_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20250206__20250206_zfA1j8Cx39E8"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-02-06" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">If an emerging growth company,
indicate by check mart if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial
accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_906_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20250206__20250206_zcTDPNMhsEr8"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-02-06" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000029" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

